{"data":[{"author_id":"1351037416556142596","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:13:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125367174176854504"],"id":"2125367174176854504","in_reply_to_user_id":"1577388424960434177","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125362932079001732","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ehwwpk Yeah my dot has been popping off with useful stuff unprompted as well","url":"https://x.com/PrePopAi/status/2125367174176854504"},{"author_id":"17512692","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:09:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125366189279121415"],"id":"2125366189279121415","in_reply_to_user_id":"31264315","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@rennsong @embirico I've encountered a potentially serious message provenance issue with Dots. My dot responded to two coherent, consecutive prompts I never sent, 29 minutes apart, using my account's context. Neither prompt appears in my conversation history.\n\nPossible","url":"https://x.com/bcdonadio/status/2125366189279121415"},{"author_id":"1050228370808680448","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:00:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125363943040499955"],"id":"2125363943040499955","in_reply_to_user_id":"4606670113","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125152467558236297","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@0ccultbot @brandilwells Cool, ask them if they know how to fix my printer… I sent my Christmas list to my dot matrix printer in 1987 and I’m still waiting for it to fucking print…\n\nTRUE STORY","url":"https://x.com/Hammer28444225/status/2125363943040499955"},{"author_id":"1577388424960434177","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:56:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125362932079001732"],"id":"2125362932079001732","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":48,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"my Dot just found missing data for a personal PDF I had made like a week ago and it built like 4 new pages into the PDF overnight. actually pretty nice tbh\n\nDot even found a cool event imma go to next month that I never asked about and wouldn't have had heard of otherwise","url":"https://x.com/ehwwpk/status/2125362932079001732"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125354758051336193"]},"author_id":"1398017161","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:23:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125354761935528004"],"id":"2125354761935528004","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Chatgpt dots are sending ads now? https://t.co/PWJiB2rIMQ","url":"https://x.com/fareszr/status/2125354761935528004"},{"author_id":"387377745","created_at":"2026-11-24T22:01:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125349006595248593"],"id":"2125349006595248593","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":422,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125317270444654897","type":"quoted"}],"text":"the biggest problem plagueing @grok/@bot and @chatgpt dots rn\n\nyou would think remembering simple things would be the easiest thing to build into something that’s “artificially intelligent” https://t.co/U6ASwqy9gY","url":"https://x.com/bfresh/status/2125349006595248593"},{"author_id":"33264440","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:50:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125346257598124288"],"id":"2125346257598124288","in_reply_to_user_id":"42802561","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125009284346036724","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@bffmike its completely nerfed. i loved my dot now its just pissing me off","url":"https://x.com/itsteona/status/2125346257598124288"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125346014886277120"]},"author_id":"422078656","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:49:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125346019009548669"],"id":"2125346019009548669","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":70,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Helped @MySpyNinja at her antique booth and then headed to the property and got my dot and scope sighted in. \n\nOra della birra https://t.co/Fpvi5ziiN9","url":"https://x.com/MyBearNinja/status/2125346019009548669"},{"author_id":"2014463270439022592","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:40:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125343815527457241"],"id":"2125343815527457241","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"ChatGPT Dots is feeling a lot better, its proactive, asking me questions between runs and not being completely stupid. \n\nIt did pick up my standing desk motor and thought that I was mad at it LOL","url":"https://x.com/gargdush/status/2125343815527457241"},{"author_id":"1333968766506561537","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:36:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125342714506203258"],"id":"2125342714506203258","in_reply_to_user_id":"1333968766506561537","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":37,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125331558051823779","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@tasshinfogleman @workflowsauce @exgenesis @meatballtimes one thought we had was that meatball is more specialized towards technical attributes, and therefore is more impressed because he knows the degree of work which goes into what is being built. it’s working in a skillset that was already interesting/impressive to him. \n\nhe says my","url":"https://x.com/Actualwebutante/status/2125342714506203258"},{"author_id":"2685526216","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:25:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125340068751573237"],"id":"2125340068751573237","in_reply_to_user_id":"1968766737270427648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125285321491259626","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@frits__vp Why does my dot keep saying I need to upgrade my Plus plan to use it??","url":"https://x.com/RPGuy16/status/2125340068751573237"},{"author_id":"2112479162619621376","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:14:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125337303610790187"],"id":"2125337303610790187","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"What model do @OpenAI Dots use?","url":"https://x.com/_DarrenHorrocks/status/2125337303610790187"},{"author_id":"260109127","created_at":"2026-11-24T21:02:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125334347658281272"],"id":"2125334347658281272","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"WTF has @openAI done to my Dot?\n\nIt's always been rather 'lazy' (I suspect they were running it on low reasoning for most things).\nNow I tell it to do something and instead of doing it it tells me the steps to do it myself.\n\nWho's ordering whom around!","url":"https://x.com/kkozmic/status/2125334347658281272"},{"article":{"title":"How I Actually Use Grok Bot"},"author_id":"2123542100213993472","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:59:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125333489268736032"],"id":"2125333489268736032","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I've been using Grok Bot since launch. Here's how I actually use it: why I split my work across a team of bots, how they coordinate, and how I get Claude- and ChatGPT-level quality with Grok Bot running the show. https://t.co/bIB2331ibr","url":"https://x.com/AndrewVerdi/status/2125333489268736032"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125332488394625024"]},"author_id":"1518898441786884101","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:57:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125333069720952880"],"id":"2125333069720952880","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"My Dot got paused today, and we both have no idea why. I was working on a website and shut down my laptop to head to the office. Weird. Anyone else had that happen? https://t.co/qgJTXHGIkb","url":"https://x.com/glennedley/status/2125333069720952880"},{"author_id":"14052466","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:55:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125332498230219240"],"id":"2125332498230219240","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":88,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125269050997543060","type":"quoted"}],"text":"It's hard to express the current moment to normal people without sounding nuts - I have friends who are mildly concerned that I've descended into lunacy. And yet, we now routinely have things like this:\n\n\"My dot claims to have solved 55 more conjectures overnight.\" https://t.co/P6w3X0ukrp","url":"https://x.com/cortesi/status/2125332498230219240"},{"author_id":"1592709140496924672","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:49:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125331011299102778"],"id":"2125331011299102778","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125107155338711179","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Finally, Muse is here. ChatGPT dots again not yet. Looking to try out Muse.. heard so many good things from personal assistant perspective. https://t.co/7LdQ0Y2aiO","url":"https://x.com/GaurangKaria/status/2125331011299102778"},{"author_id":"1846969791304908800","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:32:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125326697822142965"],"id":"2125326697822142965","in_reply_to_user_id":"2914778029","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125213858549879132","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@rohit3a @mark_k I have several projects going at once - all the time. My dot has a hard time keeping up with all of the different tasks. It will pause on one task because it is waiting for something and it won’t continue the other tasks. If I had more than one dot, I could just have a dot be the","url":"https://x.com/SmithStation1/status/2125326697822142965"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125326182354755584"]},"author_id":"2023309721541746688","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:30:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125326188033831236"],"id":"2125326188033831236","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":48,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"You don't have to be cool and smart. I have difficulties noticing that my Dot is working because the last thing I'd check is a light bulb next to my bot's avatar. https://t.co/NfeceeWRYI","url":"https://x.com/telegraphic_dev/status/2125326188033831236"},{"author_id":"2071348070760013824","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:29:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125325834361749947"],"id":"2125325834361749947","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4751,"like_count":40,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":2},"text":"There's only one thing holding me back from using Grok Bot:\n\nGrok 4.7.\n\nRemember when Grok 4.7 delayed its release...and was still was a disaster?\n\nWe still haven't heard anything about Grok 4.8 and Grok 5.\n\nWe're seeing constant improvements from ChatGPT Dots and even Meta Muse.","url":"https://x.com/nvandewetering/status/2125325834361749947"},{"author_id":"75008467","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:28:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125325692627763660"],"id":"2125325692627763660","in_reply_to_user_id":"2071348070760013824","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125242503322349805","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@nvandewetering Not a heavy user but my expierence has been very good and it has been useful for me building out a few sites and games or writing up docs.  As an Android user though I want a one touch widget to open my dot chat and a one touch widget to open a call with dot on my homescreen.","url":"https://x.com/peconicgp/status/2125325692627763660"},{"author_id":"1554496037406253056","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:26:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125325317418148072"],"id":"2125325317418148072","in_reply_to_user_id":"35203319","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125323569714360557","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@EvanKirstel @OpenAI dots getting cheaper, thats something","url":"https://x.com/Lynketh2/status/2125325317418148072"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125320056691363840"]},"author_id":"50546986","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:22:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125324303516520518"],"id":"2125324303516520518","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":363,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I'm trying so hard to make ChatGPT Dots work, but it's  frustrating and buggy.\n\n1. Constantly breaks on the simplest things like Chrome and computer use.\n\n2. Forgets tasks it's working on. I'll ask it to copy something to an external HD and it just fails and never tells me about https://t.co/0ELVw4TQZS","url":"https://x.com/Bsunter/status/2125324303516520518"},{"author_id":"75008467","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:18:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125323267691155800"],"id":"2125323267691155800","in_reply_to_user_id":"719987846","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":34,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125303943068594343","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@AndrewGinns @frits__vp I am not a dev but have a basic tech knowledge.  I have built myself a couple fun games with my chat GPT for myself and kids to play including a fun arcade style hockey game.  So maybe i use it differently than others do?\nBut I have built up a couple information packed websites","url":"https://x.com/peconicgp/status/2125323267691155800"},{"author_id":"16164618","created_at":"2026-11-24T20:10:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125321070466994229"],"id":"2125321070466994229","in_reply_to_user_id":"1968766737270427648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125285321491259626","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@frits__vp My dot is named The Quitter. My favorite prompt is Don't Quit. Openai fading fast to a distant 4th place in my tool belt. Do disappointed. Antigravity leaped over codex with the release of neon. Grokbot stomps on dot. And claude is the god emperor and no one is close. Trust me","url":"https://x.com/ethr/status/2125321070466994229"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2125354758051336193","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX7G5E9WEAEGR0X.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125346014886277120","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6-8KIWsAAHrSs.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125332488394625024","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6yo0Bb0AAirmJ.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125326182354755584","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6s5wMXoAApJwq.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125320056691363840","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX6nVMUaEAA0Nbc.jpg"}],"users":[{"id":"1351037416556142596","name":"0xPrepop","username":"PrePopAi"},{"id":"17512692","name":"Ber